window.__code__["redis-message-bus-py"] = {"code_id": "redis-message-bus-py", "kind": "src", "title": "_redis_message_bus.py", "source_path": "agentscope/src/agentscope/app/message_bus/_redis_message_bus.py", "highlight_line": null, "code_html": "<div class=\"code-body\">\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"1\"><span class=\"c-no\">1</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># -*- coding: utf-8 -*-</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"2\"><span class=\"c-no\">2</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;The Redis-backed message bus implementation.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"3\"><span class=\"c-no\">3</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> asyncio</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"4\"><span class=\"c-no\">4</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> json</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"5\"><span class=\"c-no\">5</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> uuid</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"6\"><span class=\"c-no\">6</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> collections.abc <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> AsyncGenerator</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"7\"><span class=\"c-no\">7</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> contextlib <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> asynccontextmanager</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"8\"><span class=\"c-no\">8</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> typing <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> Any, Callable, Self, TYPE_CHECKING</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"9\"><span class=\"c-no\">9</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"10\"><span class=\"c-no\">10</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> ._base <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> MessageBus</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"11\"><span class=\"c-no\">11</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"12\"><span class=\"c-no\">12</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> TYPE_CHECKING:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"13\"><span class=\"c-no\">13</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> redis.asyncio <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> ConnectionPool, Redis</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"14\"><span class=\"c-no\">14</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">else</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"15\"><span class=\"c-no\">15</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ConnectionPool = Any</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"16\"><span class=\"c-no\">16</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Redis = Any</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"17\"><span class=\"c-no\">17</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"18\"><span class=\"c-no\">18</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"19\"><span class=\"c-no\">19</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> RedisMessageBus(MessageBus):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"20\"><span class=\"c-no\">20</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Redis-backed implementation of :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`MessageBus`.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"21\"><span class=\"c-no\">21</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"22\"><span class=\"c-no\">22</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Mapping of bus modes to Redis primitives:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"23\"><span class=\"c-no\">23</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"24\"><span class=\"c-no\">24</span><span class=\"c-src\">    - **Mode A (drain queue)** uses a Redis Stream per key. ``XADD``</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"25\"><span class=\"c-no\">25</span><span class=\"c-src\">      appends a payload whose single field ``payload`` carries the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"26\"><span class=\"c-no\">26</span><span class=\"c-src\">      JSON-serialised dict. ``queue_drain`` performs ``XRANGE`` followed</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"27\"><span class=\"c-no\">27</span><span class=\"c-src\">      by per-id ``XDEL`` so the read <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> destructive <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> idempotent</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"28\"><span class=\"c-no\">28</span><span class=\"c-src\">      under the single-consumer-per-key invariant. ``ttl_secs`` <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"29\"><span class=\"c-no\">29</span><span class=\"c-src\">      enforced via ``EXPIRE`` after each push (sliding TTL).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"30\"><span class=\"c-no\">30</span><span class=\"c-src\">    - **Mode C (replay log)** also uses a Redis Stream, but never</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"31\"><span class=\"c-no\">31</span><span class=\"c-src\">      ``XDEL``s on read. Trimming happens via ``XADD … MAXLEN ~N``</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"32\"><span class=\"c-no\">32</span><span class=\"c-src\">      (approximate, <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> performance) on append, via the ``ttl_secs``</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"33\"><span class=\"c-no\">33</span><span class=\"c-src\">      ``EXPIRE`` on the whole key, <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> explicitly via</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"34\"><span class=\"c-no\">34</span><span class=\"c-src\">      :meth:`log_trim`. ``log_read`` uses ``XRANGE`` <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> an exclusive</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"35\"><span class=\"c-no\">35</span><span class=\"c-src\">      start id derived <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> ``since``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"36\"><span class=\"c-no\">36</span><span class=\"c-src\">    - **Mode D (transient broadcast)** rides Redis Pub/Sub. Wake-ups</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"37\"><span class=\"c-no\">37</span><span class=\"c-src\">      are best-effort: payloads published before a subscription exists</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"38\"><span class=\"c-no\">38</span><span class=\"c-src\">      are <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> delivered.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"39\"><span class=\"c-no\">39</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"40\"><span class=\"c-no\">40</span><span class=\"c-src\">    The bus owns its own connection pool by default; an external pool</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"41\"><span class=\"c-no\">41</span><span class=\"c-src\">    may be supplied <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> tests <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> sharing a pool across services.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"42\"><span class=\"c-no\">42</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"43\"><span class=\"c-no\">43</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"44\"><span class=\"c-no\">44</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> __init__(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"45\"><span class=\"c-no\">45</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"46\"><span class=\"c-no\">46</span><span class=\"c-src\">        host: str = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;localhost&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"47\"><span class=\"c-no\">47</span><span class=\"c-src\">        port: int = 6379,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"48\"><span class=\"c-no\">48</span><span class=\"c-src\">        db: int = 0,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"49\"><span class=\"c-no\">49</span><span class=\"c-src\">        password: str | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"50\"><span class=\"c-no\">50</span><span class=\"c-src\">        connection_pool: ConnectionPool | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"51\"><span class=\"c-no\">51</span><span class=\"c-src\">        **kwargs: Any,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"52\"><span class=\"c-no\">52</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"53\"><span class=\"c-no\">53</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Store connection parameters; the actual pool <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> created <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"54\"><span class=\"c-no\">54</span><span class=\"c-src\">        :meth:`__aenter__`.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"55\"><span class=\"c-no\">55</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"56\"><span class=\"c-no\">56</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"57\"><span class=\"c-no\">57</span><span class=\"c-src\">            host (`str`, defaults to ``<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;localhost&quot;</span>``):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"58\"><span class=\"c-no\">58</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Redis server host.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"59\"><span class=\"c-no\">59</span><span class=\"c-src\">            port (`int`, defaults to ``6379``):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"60\"><span class=\"c-no\">60</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Redis server port.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"61\"><span class=\"c-no\">61</span><span class=\"c-src\">            db (`int`, defaults to ``0``):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"62\"><span class=\"c-no\">62</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Redis logical database index.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"63\"><span class=\"c-no\">63</span><span class=\"c-src\">            password (`str | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"64\"><span class=\"c-no\">64</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Redis password <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> required by the server.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"65\"><span class=\"c-no\">65</span><span class=\"c-src\">            connection_pool (`ConnectionPool | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"66\"><span class=\"c-no\">66</span><span class=\"c-src\">                An externally managed connection pool. When provided</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"67\"><span class=\"c-no\">67</span><span class=\"c-src\">                the pool <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> used <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span>-<span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> **<span class=\"c-kw\">not</span>** closed by</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"68\"><span class=\"c-no\">68</span><span class=\"c-src\">                :meth:`aclose` — the caller retains ownership of its</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"69\"><span class=\"c-no\">69</span><span class=\"c-src\">                lifecycle. When omitted a pool <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> created <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"70\"><span class=\"c-no\">70</span><span class=\"c-src\">                *host*/*port*/*db*/*password* on :meth:`__aenter__`</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"71\"><span class=\"c-no\">71</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> closed on :meth:`aclose`.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"72\"><span class=\"c-no\">72</span><span class=\"c-src\">            **kwargs (`Any`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"73\"><span class=\"c-no\">73</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Extra keyword arguments forwarded to</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"74\"><span class=\"c-no\">74</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``redis.asyncio.ConnectionPool`` when the pool <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"75\"><span class=\"c-no\">75</span><span class=\"c-src\">                created internally (e.g. ``max_connections=20``,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"76\"><span class=\"c-no\">76</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``socket_timeout=5``).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"77\"><span class=\"c-no\">77</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"78\"><span class=\"c-no\">78</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._host = host</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"79\"><span class=\"c-no\">79</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._port = port</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"80\"><span class=\"c-no\">80</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._db = db</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"81\"><span class=\"c-no\">81</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._password = password</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"82\"><span class=\"c-no\">82</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._external_pool: ConnectionPool | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = connection_pool</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"83\"><span class=\"c-no\">83</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._kwargs = kwargs</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"84\"><span class=\"c-no\">84</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"85\"><span class=\"c-no\">85</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># Populated in __aenter__; None until the context is entered.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"86\"><span class=\"c-no\">86</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client: Redis | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"87\"><span class=\"c-no\">87</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._owned_pool: ConnectionPool | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"88\"><span class=\"c-no\">88</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"89\"><span class=\"c-no\">89</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> __aenter__(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; Self:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"90\"><span class=\"c-no\">90</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Create the connection pool <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> Redis client.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"91\"><span class=\"c-no\">91</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"92\"><span class=\"c-no\">92</span><span class=\"c-src\">        If an external pool was supplied at construction time it <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"93\"><span class=\"c-no\">93</span><span class=\"c-src\">        used directly <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> its lifecycle remains the caller&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"94\"><span class=\"c-no\">94</span><span class=\"c-src\">        responsibility. Otherwise, an internal pool <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> created <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"95\"><span class=\"c-no\">95</span><span class=\"c-src\">        stored host/port/db parameters <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> will be closed by</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"96\"><span class=\"c-no\">96</span><span class=\"c-src\">        :meth:`aclose`.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"97\"><span class=\"c-no\">97</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"98\"><span class=\"c-no\">98</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"99\"><span class=\"c-no\">99</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `Self`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"100\"><span class=\"c-no\">100</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The bus, ready <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> use <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> an <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> context manager.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"101\"><span class=\"c-no\">101</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"102\"><span class=\"c-no\">102</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"103\"><span class=\"c-no\">103</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> redis.asyncio <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> aioredis</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"104\"><span class=\"c-no\">104</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">except</span> ImportError <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> e:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"105\"><span class=\"c-no\">105</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">raise</span> ImportError(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"106\"><span class=\"c-no\">106</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;The &#x27;redis&#x27; package is required for RedisMessageBus. &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"107\"><span class=\"c-no\">107</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Install it with: pip install redis[async]&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"108\"><span class=\"c-no\">108</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ) <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> e</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"109\"><span class=\"c-no\">109</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"110\"><span class=\"c-no\">110</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._external_pool <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"111\"><span class=\"c-no\">111</span><span class=\"c-src\">            pool = <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._external_pool</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"112\"><span class=\"c-no\">112</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">else</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"113\"><span class=\"c-no\">113</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._owned_pool = aioredis.ConnectionPool(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"114\"><span class=\"c-no\">114</span><span class=\"c-src\">                host=<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._host,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"115\"><span class=\"c-no\">115</span><span class=\"c-src\">                port=<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._port,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"116\"><span class=\"c-no\">116</span><span class=\"c-src\">                db=<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._db,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"117\"><span class=\"c-no\">117</span><span class=\"c-src\">                password=<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._password,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"118\"><span class=\"c-no\">118</span><span class=\"c-src\">                decode_responses=<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"119\"><span class=\"c-no\">119</span><span class=\"c-src\">                **<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._kwargs,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"120\"><span class=\"c-no\">120</span><span class=\"c-src\">            )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"121\"><span class=\"c-no\">121</span><span class=\"c-src\">            pool = <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._owned_pool</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"122\"><span class=\"c-no\">122</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"123\"><span class=\"c-no\">123</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client = aioredis.Redis(connection_pool=pool)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"124\"><span class=\"c-no\">124</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"125\"><span class=\"c-no\">125</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"126\"><span class=\"c-no\">126</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> aclose(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"127\"><span class=\"c-no\">127</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Close the connection pool <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> it was created internally.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"128\"><span class=\"c-no\">128</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"129\"><span class=\"c-no\">129</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Externally supplied pools are left open — the caller owns them.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"130\"><span class=\"c-no\">130</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"131\"><span class=\"c-no\">131</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._owned_pool <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"132\"><span class=\"c-no\">132</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._owned_pool.aclose()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"133\"><span class=\"c-no\">133</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._owned_pool = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"134\"><span class=\"c-no\">134</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"135\"><span class=\"c-no\">135</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"136\"><span class=\"c-no\">136</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> __aexit__(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"137\"><span class=\"c-no\">137</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"138\"><span class=\"c-no\">138</span><span class=\"c-src\">        exc_type: type[BaseException] | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"139\"><span class=\"c-no\">139</span><span class=\"c-src\">        exc_value: BaseException | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"140\"><span class=\"c-no\">140</span><span class=\"c-src\">        traceback: Any,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"141\"><span class=\"c-no\">141</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"142\"><span class=\"c-no\">142</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Exit the <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> context manager <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> release resources.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"143\"><span class=\"c-no\">143</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"144\"><span class=\"c-no\">144</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"145\"><span class=\"c-no\">145</span><span class=\"c-src\">            exc_type (`type[BaseException] | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"146\"><span class=\"c-no\">146</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Exception <span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> raised inside the context, <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> any.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"147\"><span class=\"c-no\">147</span><span class=\"c-src\">            exc_value (`BaseException | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"148\"><span class=\"c-no\">148</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Exception instance raised inside the context, <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> any.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"149\"><span class=\"c-no\">149</span><span class=\"c-src\">            traceback (`Any`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"150\"><span class=\"c-no\">150</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Traceback associated <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> the exception, <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> any.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"151\"><span class=\"c-no\">151</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"152\"><span class=\"c-no\">152</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.aclose()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"153\"><span class=\"c-no\">153</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"154\"><span class=\"c-no\">154</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> get_client(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; Redis:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"155\"><span class=\"c-no\">155</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return the underlying Redis client.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"156\"><span class=\"c-no\">156</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"157\"><span class=\"c-no\">157</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Only valid inside the <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> context (between :meth:`__aenter__`</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"158\"><span class=\"c-no\">158</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> :meth:`aclose`).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"159\"><span class=\"c-no\">159</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"160\"><span class=\"c-no\">160</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"161\"><span class=\"c-no\">161</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `Redis`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"162\"><span class=\"c-no\">162</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The asyncio Redis client instance.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"163\"><span class=\"c-no\">163</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"164\"><span class=\"c-no\">164</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"165\"><span class=\"c-no\">165</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"166\"><span class=\"c-no\">166</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"167\"><span class=\"c-no\">167</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># Helpers</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"168\"><span class=\"c-no\">168</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"169\"><span class=\"c-no\">169</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"170\"><span class=\"c-no\">170</span><span class=\"c-src\">    @staticmethod</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"171\"><span class=\"c-no\">171</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _exclusive_start(since: str | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"172\"><span class=\"c-no\">172</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Compute the exclusive start id <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> ``XRANGE`` given a cursor.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"173\"><span class=\"c-no\">173</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"174\"><span class=\"c-no\">174</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Redis Streams 6.2+ support the ``(`` prefix <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> exclusive</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"175\"><span class=\"c-no\">175</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ranges, so the simplest portable encoding of <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;after ``since``&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"176\"><span class=\"c-no\">176</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> ``f<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;({since}&quot;</span>``. ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`` resolves to ``<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;-&quot;</span>`` (the absolute</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"177\"><span class=\"c-no\">177</span><span class=\"c-src\">        minimum id).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"178\"><span class=\"c-no\">178</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"179\"><span class=\"c-no\">179</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"180\"><span class=\"c-no\">180</span><span class=\"c-src\">            since (`str | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"181\"><span class=\"c-no\">181</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The previous cursor returned by :meth:`log_read`, <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"182\"><span class=\"c-no\">182</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`` to read <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> the beginning.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"183\"><span class=\"c-no\">183</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"184\"><span class=\"c-no\">184</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"185\"><span class=\"c-no\">185</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `str`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"186\"><span class=\"c-no\">186</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The start argument <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> ``XRANGE``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"187\"><span class=\"c-no\">187</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"188\"><span class=\"c-no\">188</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> since <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"189\"><span class=\"c-no\">189</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;-&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"190\"><span class=\"c-no\">190</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> f<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;({since}&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"191\"><span class=\"c-no\">191</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"192\"><span class=\"c-no\">192</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"193\"><span class=\"c-no\">193</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># Mode A — drain queue</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"194\"><span class=\"c-no\">194</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"195\"><span class=\"c-no\">195</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"196\"><span class=\"c-no\">196</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> queue_push(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"197\"><span class=\"c-no\">197</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"198\"><span class=\"c-no\">198</span><span class=\"c-src\">        key: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"199\"><span class=\"c-no\">199</span><span class=\"c-src\">        payload: dict,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"200\"><span class=\"c-no\">200</span><span class=\"c-src\">        *,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"201\"><span class=\"c-no\">201</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ttl_secs: int | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"202\"><span class=\"c-no\">202</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"203\"><span class=\"c-no\">203</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Append ``payload`` to the drain queue at ``key``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"204\"><span class=\"c-no\">204</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"205\"><span class=\"c-no\">205</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"206\"><span class=\"c-no\">206</span><span class=\"c-src\">            key (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"207\"><span class=\"c-no\">207</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Stream key <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> this drain queue.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"208\"><span class=\"c-no\">208</span><span class=\"c-src\">            payload (`dict`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"209\"><span class=\"c-no\">209</span><span class=\"c-src\">                JSON-serializable dict; encoded into the ``payload``</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"210\"><span class=\"c-no\">210</span><span class=\"c-src\">                field of a Redis Stream entry.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"211\"><span class=\"c-no\">211</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ttl_secs (`int | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"212\"><span class=\"c-no\">212</span><span class=\"c-src\">                If set, refresh the key&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s expiry on every push</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"213\"><span class=\"c-no\">213</span><span class=\"c-src\">                (sliding TTL). ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`` means no TTL — the queue</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"214\"><span class=\"c-no\">214</span><span class=\"c-src\">                persists until drained <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> deleted explicitly.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"215\"><span class=\"c-no\">215</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"216\"><span class=\"c-no\">216</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"217\"><span class=\"c-no\">217</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `str`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"218\"><span class=\"c-no\">218</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The Redis Stream entry id assigned by ``XADD``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"219\"><span class=\"c-no\">219</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"220\"><span class=\"c-no\">220</span><span class=\"c-src\">        entry_id = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.xadd(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"221\"><span class=\"c-no\">221</span><span class=\"c-src\">            key,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"222\"><span class=\"c-no\">222</span><span class=\"c-src\">            {<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;payload&quot;</span>: json.dumps(payload, ensure_ascii=<span class=\"c-kw\">False</span>)},</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"223\"><span class=\"c-no\">223</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"224\"><span class=\"c-no\">224</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> ttl_secs <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"225\"><span class=\"c-no\">225</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.expire(key, ttl_secs)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"226\"><span class=\"c-no\">226</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> entry_id</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"227\"><span class=\"c-no\">227</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"228\"><span class=\"c-no\">228</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> queue_drain(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"229\"><span class=\"c-no\">229</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"230\"><span class=\"c-no\">230</span><span class=\"c-src\">        key: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"231\"><span class=\"c-no\">231</span><span class=\"c-src\">        max_count: int = 100,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"232\"><span class=\"c-no\">232</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; list[tuple[str, dict]]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"233\"><span class=\"c-no\">233</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Drain up to ``max_count`` entries <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> the queue at ``key``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"234\"><span class=\"c-no\">234</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"235\"><span class=\"c-no\">235</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Implementation: ``XRANGE`` followed by ``XDEL`` of the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"236\"><span class=\"c-no\">236</span><span class=\"c-src\">        returned ids, so the operation <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> destructive <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> a single</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"237\"><span class=\"c-no\">237</span><span class=\"c-src\">        round-trip pair. Entries that arrive between ``XRANGE`` <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"238\"><span class=\"c-no\">238</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ``XDEL`` are <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> affected.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"239\"><span class=\"c-no\">239</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"240\"><span class=\"c-no\">240</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"241\"><span class=\"c-no\">241</span><span class=\"c-src\">            key (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"242\"><span class=\"c-no\">242</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Stream key <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> the drain queue.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"243\"><span class=\"c-no\">243</span><span class=\"c-src\">            max_count (`int`, defaults to ``100``):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"244\"><span class=\"c-no\">244</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Maximum entries to <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> one call.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"245\"><span class=\"c-no\">245</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"246\"><span class=\"c-no\">246</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"247\"><span class=\"c-no\">247</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `list[tuple[str, dict]]`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"248\"><span class=\"c-no\">248</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``(entry_id, payload)`` pairs <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> arrival order. Empty</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"249\"><span class=\"c-no\">249</span><span class=\"c-src\">                list when the queue <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> empty <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> absent.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"250\"><span class=\"c-no\">250</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"251\"><span class=\"c-no\">251</span><span class=\"c-src\">        entries = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.xrange(key, count=max_count)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"252\"><span class=\"c-no\">252</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> entries:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"253\"><span class=\"c-no\">253</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> []</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"254\"><span class=\"c-no\">254</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"255\"><span class=\"c-no\">255</span><span class=\"c-src\">        results: list[tuple[str, dict]] = []</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"256\"><span class=\"c-no\">256</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ids_to_delete: list[str] = []</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"257\"><span class=\"c-no\">257</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> entry_id, fields <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> entries:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"258\"><span class=\"c-no\">258</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ids_to_delete.append(entry_id)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"259\"><span class=\"c-no\">259</span><span class=\"c-src\">            raw = fields.get(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;payload&quot;</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"260\"><span class=\"c-no\">260</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> raw <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"261\"><span class=\"c-no\">261</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">continue</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"262\"><span class=\"c-no\">262</span><span class=\"c-src\">            results.append((entry_id, json.loads(raw)))</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"263\"><span class=\"c-no\">263</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"264\"><span class=\"c-no\">264</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> ids_to_delete:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"265\"><span class=\"c-no\">265</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.xdel(key, *ids_to_delete)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"266\"><span class=\"c-no\">266</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"267\"><span class=\"c-no\">267</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> results</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"268\"><span class=\"c-no\">268</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"269\"><span class=\"c-no\">269</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> queue_delete(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, key: str) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"270\"><span class=\"c-no\">270</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Delete the drain queue at ``key``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"271\"><span class=\"c-no\">271</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"272\"><span class=\"c-no\">272</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"273\"><span class=\"c-no\">273</span><span class=\"c-src\">            key (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"274\"><span class=\"c-no\">274</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Stream key <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> the drain queue. ``DEL`` <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> a no-op</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"275\"><span class=\"c-no\">275</span><span class=\"c-src\">                when the key does <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> exist.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"276\"><span class=\"c-no\">276</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"277\"><span class=\"c-no\">277</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.delete(key)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"278\"><span class=\"c-no\">278</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"279\"><span class=\"c-no\">279</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"280\"><span class=\"c-no\">280</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># Mode C — replay log</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"281\"><span class=\"c-no\">281</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"282\"><span class=\"c-no\">282</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"283\"><span class=\"c-no\">283</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> log_append(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"284\"><span class=\"c-no\">284</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"285\"><span class=\"c-no\">285</span><span class=\"c-src\">        key: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"286\"><span class=\"c-no\">286</span><span class=\"c-src\">        payload: dict,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"287\"><span class=\"c-no\">287</span><span class=\"c-src\">        *,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"288\"><span class=\"c-no\">288</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ttl_secs: int | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"289\"><span class=\"c-no\">289</span><span class=\"c-src\">        max_len: int | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"290\"><span class=\"c-no\">290</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"291\"><span class=\"c-no\">291</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Append ``payload`` to the replay log at ``key``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"292\"><span class=\"c-no\">292</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"293\"><span class=\"c-no\">293</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"294\"><span class=\"c-no\">294</span><span class=\"c-src\">            key (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"295\"><span class=\"c-no\">295</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Stream key <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> this replay log.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"296\"><span class=\"c-no\">296</span><span class=\"c-src\">            payload (`dict`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"297\"><span class=\"c-no\">297</span><span class=\"c-src\">                JSON-serializable dict; encoded into the ``payload``</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"298\"><span class=\"c-no\">298</span><span class=\"c-src\">                field of a Redis Stream entry.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"299\"><span class=\"c-no\">299</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ttl_secs (`int | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"300\"><span class=\"c-no\">300</span><span class=\"c-src\">                If set, refresh the key&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s expiry on every append</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"301\"><span class=\"c-no\">301</span><span class=\"c-src\">                (sliding TTL). ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`` means no TTL.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"302\"><span class=\"c-no\">302</span><span class=\"c-src\">            max_len (`int | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"303\"><span class=\"c-no\">303</span><span class=\"c-src\">                If set, cap the log at approximately this many entries</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"304\"><span class=\"c-no\">304</span><span class=\"c-src\">                using ``XADD MAXLEN ~N``. The cap <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> approximate so</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"305\"><span class=\"c-no\">305</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Redis can use its O(1) trim-by-radix-tree-node mode.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"306\"><span class=\"c-no\">306</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`` means no cap.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"307\"><span class=\"c-no\">307</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"308\"><span class=\"c-no\">308</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"309\"><span class=\"c-no\">309</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `str`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"310\"><span class=\"c-no\">310</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The Redis Stream entry id, suitable <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> a cursor <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"311\"><span class=\"c-no\">311</span><span class=\"c-src\">                later :meth:`log_read` calls.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"312\"><span class=\"c-no\">312</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"313\"><span class=\"c-no\">313</span><span class=\"c-src\">        kwargs: dict[str, Any] = {}</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"314\"><span class=\"c-no\">314</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> max_len <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"315\"><span class=\"c-no\">315</span><span class=\"c-src\">            kwargs[<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;maxlen&quot;</span>] = max_len</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"316\"><span class=\"c-no\">316</span><span class=\"c-src\">            kwargs[<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;approximate&quot;</span>] = <span class=\"c-kw\">True</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"317\"><span class=\"c-no\">317</span><span class=\"c-src\">        entry_id = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.xadd(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"318\"><span class=\"c-no\">318</span><span class=\"c-src\">            key,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"319\"><span class=\"c-no\">319</span><span class=\"c-src\">            {<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;payload&quot;</span>: json.dumps(payload, ensure_ascii=<span class=\"c-kw\">False</span>)},</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"320\"><span class=\"c-no\">320</span><span class=\"c-src\">            **kwargs,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"321\"><span class=\"c-no\">321</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"322\"><span class=\"c-no\">322</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> ttl_secs <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"323\"><span class=\"c-no\">323</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.expire(key, ttl_secs)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"324\"><span class=\"c-no\">324</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> entry_id</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"325\"><span class=\"c-no\">325</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"326\"><span class=\"c-no\">326</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> log_read(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"327\"><span class=\"c-no\">327</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"328\"><span class=\"c-no\">328</span><span class=\"c-src\">        key: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"329\"><span class=\"c-no\">329</span><span class=\"c-src\">        since: str | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"330\"><span class=\"c-no\">330</span><span class=\"c-src\">        max_count: int = 100,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"331\"><span class=\"c-no\">331</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; list[tuple[str, dict]]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"332\"><span class=\"c-no\">332</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Read up to ``max_count`` entries newer than ``since``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"333\"><span class=\"c-no\">333</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"334\"><span class=\"c-no\">334</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"335\"><span class=\"c-no\">335</span><span class=\"c-src\">            key (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"336\"><span class=\"c-no\">336</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Stream key <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> the replay log.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"337\"><span class=\"c-no\">337</span><span class=\"c-src\">            since (`str | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"338\"><span class=\"c-no\">338</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Exclusive cursor — <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> entries strictly newer than</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"339\"><span class=\"c-no\">339</span><span class=\"c-src\">                this id (typically the last id <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> a previous read).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"340\"><span class=\"c-no\">340</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`` reads <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> the beginning.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"341\"><span class=\"c-no\">341</span><span class=\"c-src\">            max_count (`int`, defaults to ``100``):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"342\"><span class=\"c-no\">342</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Maximum entries to <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span>.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"343\"><span class=\"c-no\">343</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"344\"><span class=\"c-no\">344</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"345\"><span class=\"c-no\">345</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `list[tuple[str, dict]]`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"346\"><span class=\"c-no\">346</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``(entry_id, payload)`` pairs <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> append order.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"347\"><span class=\"c-no\">347</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"348\"><span class=\"c-no\">348</span><span class=\"c-src\">        start = <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._exclusive_start(since)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"349\"><span class=\"c-no\">349</span><span class=\"c-src\">        entries = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.xrange(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"350\"><span class=\"c-no\">350</span><span class=\"c-src\">            key,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"351\"><span class=\"c-no\">351</span><span class=\"c-src\">            min=start,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"352\"><span class=\"c-no\">352</span><span class=\"c-src\">            count=max_count,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"353\"><span class=\"c-no\">353</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"354\"><span class=\"c-no\">354</span><span class=\"c-src\">        results: list[tuple[str, dict]] = []</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"355\"><span class=\"c-no\">355</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> entry_id, fields <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> entries:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"356\"><span class=\"c-no\">356</span><span class=\"c-src\">            raw = fields.get(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;payload&quot;</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"357\"><span class=\"c-no\">357</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> raw <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"358\"><span class=\"c-no\">358</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">continue</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"359\"><span class=\"c-no\">359</span><span class=\"c-src\">            results.append((entry_id, json.loads(raw)))</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"360\"><span class=\"c-no\">360</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> results</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"361\"><span class=\"c-no\">361</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"362\"><span class=\"c-no\">362</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> log_trim(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"363\"><span class=\"c-no\">363</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"364\"><span class=\"c-no\">364</span><span class=\"c-src\">        key: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"365\"><span class=\"c-no\">365</span><span class=\"c-src\">        before_id: str | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"366\"><span class=\"c-no\">366</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"367\"><span class=\"c-no\">367</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Trim the replay log at ``key``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"368\"><span class=\"c-no\">368</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"369\"><span class=\"c-no\">369</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"370\"><span class=\"c-no\">370</span><span class=\"c-src\">            key (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"371\"><span class=\"c-no\">371</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Stream key <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> the replay log.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"372\"><span class=\"c-no\">372</span><span class=\"c-src\">            before_id (`str | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"373\"><span class=\"c-no\">373</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Drop all entries <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> id strictly older than this.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"374\"><span class=\"c-no\">374</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`` deletes the entire key.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"375\"><span class=\"c-no\">375</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"376\"><span class=\"c-no\">376</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> before_id <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"377\"><span class=\"c-no\">377</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.delete(key)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"378\"><span class=\"c-no\">378</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"379\"><span class=\"c-no\">379</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># XTRIM MINID drops entries with id &lt; before_id.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"380\"><span class=\"c-no\">380</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.xtrim(key, minid=before_id)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"381\"><span class=\"c-no\">381</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"382\"><span class=\"c-no\">382</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"383\"><span class=\"c-no\">383</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># Mode F — registry map (hash-keyed namespace)</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"384\"><span class=\"c-no\">384</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"385\"><span class=\"c-no\">385</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"386\"><span class=\"c-no\">386</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> registry_set(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"387\"><span class=\"c-no\">387</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"388\"><span class=\"c-no\">388</span><span class=\"c-src\">        namespace: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"389\"><span class=\"c-no\">389</span><span class=\"c-src\">        field: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"390\"><span class=\"c-no\">390</span><span class=\"c-src\">        value: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"391\"><span class=\"c-no\">391</span><span class=\"c-src\">        *,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"392\"><span class=\"c-no\">392</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ttl_secs: int | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"393\"><span class=\"c-no\">393</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"394\"><span class=\"c-no\">394</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Set ``field`` <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> the Redis Hash at ``namespace``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"395\"><span class=\"c-no\">395</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"396\"><span class=\"c-no\">396</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"397\"><span class=\"c-no\">397</span><span class=\"c-src\">            namespace (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"398\"><span class=\"c-no\">398</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Hash key.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"399\"><span class=\"c-no\">399</span><span class=\"c-src\">            field (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"400\"><span class=\"c-no\">400</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Hash field.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"401\"><span class=\"c-no\">401</span><span class=\"c-src\">            value (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"402\"><span class=\"c-no\">402</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Value to store.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"403\"><span class=\"c-no\">403</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ttl_secs (`int | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"404\"><span class=\"c-no\">404</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Refresh the key&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s expiry (sliding TTL).</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"405\"><span class=\"c-no\">405</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"406\"><span class=\"c-no\">406</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.hset(namespace, field, value)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"407\"><span class=\"c-no\">407</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> ttl_secs <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"408\"><span class=\"c-no\">408</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.expire(namespace, ttl_secs)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"409\"><span class=\"c-no\">409</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"410\"><span class=\"c-no\">410</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> registry_del(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, namespace: str, field: str) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"411\"><span class=\"c-no\">411</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Remove ``field`` <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> the Redis Hash at ``namespace``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"412\"><span class=\"c-no\">412</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"413\"><span class=\"c-no\">413</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"414\"><span class=\"c-no\">414</span><span class=\"c-src\">            namespace (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"415\"><span class=\"c-no\">415</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Hash key.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"416\"><span class=\"c-no\">416</span><span class=\"c-src\">            field (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"417\"><span class=\"c-no\">417</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Hash field to remove.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"418\"><span class=\"c-no\">418</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"419\"><span class=\"c-no\">419</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.hdel(namespace, field)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"420\"><span class=\"c-no\">420</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"421\"><span class=\"c-no\">421</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> registry_exists(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, namespace: str, field: str) -&gt; bool:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"422\"><span class=\"c-no\">422</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return whether ``field`` exists <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> the Hash at ``namespace``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"423\"><span class=\"c-no\">423</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"424\"><span class=\"c-no\">424</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"425\"><span class=\"c-no\">425</span><span class=\"c-src\">            namespace (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"426\"><span class=\"c-no\">426</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Hash key.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"427\"><span class=\"c-no\">427</span><span class=\"c-src\">            field (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"428\"><span class=\"c-no\">428</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Hash field to check.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"429\"><span class=\"c-no\">429</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"430\"><span class=\"c-no\">430</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"431\"><span class=\"c-no\">431</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `bool`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"432\"><span class=\"c-no\">432</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>`` <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> the field exists.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"433\"><span class=\"c-no\">433</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"434\"><span class=\"c-no\">434</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> bool(<span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.hexists(namespace, field))</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"435\"><span class=\"c-no\">435</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"436\"><span class=\"c-no\">436</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> registry_getall(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"437\"><span class=\"c-no\">437</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"438\"><span class=\"c-no\">438</span><span class=\"c-src\">        namespace: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"439\"><span class=\"c-no\">439</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; dict[str, str]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"440\"><span class=\"c-no\">440</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return all field-value pairs <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> the Hash at ``namespace``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"441\"><span class=\"c-no\">441</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"442\"><span class=\"c-no\">442</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"443\"><span class=\"c-no\">443</span><span class=\"c-src\">            namespace (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"444\"><span class=\"c-no\">444</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Hash key.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"445\"><span class=\"c-no\">445</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"446\"><span class=\"c-no\">446</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"447\"><span class=\"c-no\">447</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `dict[str, str]`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"448\"><span class=\"c-no\">448</span><span class=\"c-src\">                All entries. Empty dict when the key <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> absent.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"449\"><span class=\"c-no\">449</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"450\"><span class=\"c-no\">450</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.hgetall(namespace) <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> {}</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"451\"><span class=\"c-no\">451</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"452\"><span class=\"c-no\">452</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> registry_drop(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, namespace: str) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"453\"><span class=\"c-no\">453</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Delete the entire Hash at ``namespace``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"454\"><span class=\"c-no\">454</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"455\"><span class=\"c-no\">455</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"456\"><span class=\"c-no\">456</span><span class=\"c-src\">            namespace (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"457\"><span class=\"c-no\">457</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Hash key to delete.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"458\"><span class=\"c-no\">458</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"459\"><span class=\"c-no\">459</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.delete(namespace)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"460\"><span class=\"c-no\">460</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"461\"><span class=\"c-no\">461</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"462\"><span class=\"c-no\">462</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># Mode D — transient broadcast</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"463\"><span class=\"c-no\">463</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"464\"><span class=\"c-no\">464</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"465\"><span class=\"c-no\">465</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># Poll interval for the pub/sub read loop. Bounding each read keeps</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"466\"><span class=\"c-no\">466</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># long-lived idle subscriptions resilient: an idle ``socket_timeout``</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"467\"><span class=\"c-no\">467</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># read (raised when the connection defines one, or when the server</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"468\"><span class=\"c-no\">468</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># drops idle connections) surfaces as a benign per-poll timeout that</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"469\"><span class=\"c-no\">469</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># we ignore, instead of a fatal error that tears down the generator.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"470\"><span class=\"c-no\">470</span><span class=\"c-src\">    _SUBSCRIBE_POLL_TIMEOUT_SECS = 1.0</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"471\"><span class=\"c-no\">471</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"472\"><span class=\"c-no\">472</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> publish(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"473\"><span class=\"c-no\">473</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"474\"><span class=\"c-no\">474</span><span class=\"c-src\">        key: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"475\"><span class=\"c-no\">475</span><span class=\"c-src\">        payload: dict,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"476\"><span class=\"c-no\">476</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"477\"><span class=\"c-no\">477</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Publish ``payload`` on the broadcast channel ``key``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"478\"><span class=\"c-no\">478</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"479\"><span class=\"c-no\">479</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"480\"><span class=\"c-no\">480</span><span class=\"c-src\">            key (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"481\"><span class=\"c-no\">481</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Pub/Sub channel name.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"482\"><span class=\"c-no\">482</span><span class=\"c-src\">            payload (`dict`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"483\"><span class=\"c-no\">483</span><span class=\"c-src\">                JSON-serializable dict; encoded <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> the channel</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"484\"><span class=\"c-no\">484</span><span class=\"c-src\">                message body.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"485\"><span class=\"c-no\">485</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"486\"><span class=\"c-no\">486</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.publish(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"487\"><span class=\"c-no\">487</span><span class=\"c-src\">            key,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"488\"><span class=\"c-no\">488</span><span class=\"c-src\">            json.dumps(payload, ensure_ascii=<span class=\"c-kw\">False</span>),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"489\"><span class=\"c-no\">489</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"490\"><span class=\"c-no\">490</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"491\"><span class=\"c-no\">491</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> subscribe(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"492\"><span class=\"c-no\">492</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"493\"><span class=\"c-no\">493</span><span class=\"c-src\">        key: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"494\"><span class=\"c-no\">494</span><span class=\"c-src\">        *,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"495\"><span class=\"c-no\">495</span><span class=\"c-src\">        on_ready: Callable[[], <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>] | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"496\"><span class=\"c-no\">496</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; AsyncGenerator[dict, <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"497\"><span class=\"c-no\">497</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Yield broadcast payloads on ``key`` until the consumer</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"498\"><span class=\"c-no\">498</span><span class=\"c-src\">        closes the generator.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"499\"><span class=\"c-no\">499</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"500\"><span class=\"c-no\">500</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"501\"><span class=\"c-no\">501</span><span class=\"c-src\">            key (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"502\"><span class=\"c-no\">502</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Pub/Sub channel name.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"503\"><span class=\"c-no\">503</span><span class=\"c-src\">            on_ready (`Callable[[], <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>] | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"504\"><span class=\"c-no\">504</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Called once after ``SUBSCRIBE`` has been issued (<span class=\"c-kw\">and</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"505\"><span class=\"c-no\">505</span><span class=\"c-src\">                before any payload <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> yielded). Lets callers block on</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"506\"><span class=\"c-no\">506</span><span class=\"c-src\">                a <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;subscription is live&quot;</span> event so they can publish</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"507\"><span class=\"c-no\">507</span><span class=\"c-src\">                immediately after starting a subscriber without losing</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"508\"><span class=\"c-no\">508</span><span class=\"c-src\">                the first message to a SUBSCRIBE/PUBLISH race.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"509\"><span class=\"c-no\">509</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"510\"><span class=\"c-no\">510</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Yields:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"511\"><span class=\"c-no\">511</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `dict`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"512\"><span class=\"c-no\">512</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Each payload originally passed to :meth:`publish`.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"513\"><span class=\"c-no\">513</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"514\"><span class=\"c-no\">514</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> redis <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> exceptions <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> redis_exceptions</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"515\"><span class=\"c-no\">515</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"516\"><span class=\"c-no\">516</span><span class=\"c-src\">        pubsub = <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.pubsub()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"517\"><span class=\"c-no\">517</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"518\"><span class=\"c-no\">518</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> pubsub.subscribe(key)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"519\"><span class=\"c-no\">519</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> on_ready <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"520\"><span class=\"c-no\">520</span><span class=\"c-src\">                on_ready()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"521\"><span class=\"c-no\">521</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">while</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"522\"><span class=\"c-no\">522</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"523\"><span class=\"c-no\">523</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    message = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> pubsub.get_message(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"524\"><span class=\"c-no\">524</span><span class=\"c-src\">                        ignore_subscribe_messages=<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"525\"><span class=\"c-no\">525</span><span class=\"c-src\">                        timeout=<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._SUBSCRIBE_POLL_TIMEOUT_SECS,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"526\"><span class=\"c-no\">526</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"527\"><span class=\"c-no\">527</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">except</span> redis_exceptions.TimeoutError:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"528\"><span class=\"c-no\">528</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-com\"># Idle read timeout (e.g. the connection defines a</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"529\"><span class=\"c-no\">529</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-com\"># ``socket_timeout`` or the server drops idle</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"530\"><span class=\"c-no\">530</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-com\"># connections). No message arrived in this window;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"531\"><span class=\"c-no\">531</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-com\"># keep listening rather than crashing the loop.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"532\"><span class=\"c-no\">532</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-kw\">continue</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"533\"><span class=\"c-no\">533</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> message <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"534\"><span class=\"c-no\">534</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-com\"># No payload within the poll window — keep waiting.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"535\"><span class=\"c-no\">535</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-kw\">continue</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"536\"><span class=\"c-no\">536</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> message.get(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;type&quot;</span>) != <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;message&quot;</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"537\"><span class=\"c-no\">537</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-com\"># Skip ``subscribe`` ack and similar control frames.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"538\"><span class=\"c-no\">538</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-kw\">continue</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"539\"><span class=\"c-no\">539</span><span class=\"c-src\">                data = message.get(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;data&quot;</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"540\"><span class=\"c-no\">540</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> data <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"541\"><span class=\"c-no\">541</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-kw\">continue</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"542\"><span class=\"c-no\">542</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">yield</span> json.loads(data)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"543\"><span class=\"c-no\">543</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">finally</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"544\"><span class=\"c-no\">544</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> pubsub.unsubscribe(key)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"545\"><span class=\"c-no\">545</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> pubsub.aclose()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"546\"><span class=\"c-no\">546</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"547\"><span class=\"c-no\">547</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"548\"><span class=\"c-no\">548</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># Mode E — distributed lock</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"549\"><span class=\"c-no\">549</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"550\"><span class=\"c-no\">550</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"551\"><span class=\"c-no\">551</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># Poll interval while waiting for a contested lock.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"552\"><span class=\"c-no\">552</span><span class=\"c-src\">    _LOCK_RETRY_DELAY_SECS = 0.1</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"553\"><span class=\"c-no\">553</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"554\"><span class=\"c-no\">554</span><span class=\"c-src\">    @asynccontextmanager</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"555\"><span class=\"c-no\">555</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> acquire_lock(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"556\"><span class=\"c-no\">556</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"557\"><span class=\"c-no\">557</span><span class=\"c-src\">        key: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"558\"><span class=\"c-no\">558</span><span class=\"c-src\">        *,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"559\"><span class=\"c-no\">559</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ttl_secs: int = 600,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"560\"><span class=\"c-no\">560</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; AsyncGenerator[<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>, <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"561\"><span class=\"c-no\">561</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Acquire ``key`` <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> a distributed mutex.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"562\"><span class=\"c-no\">562</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"563\"><span class=\"c-no\">563</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Implementation:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"564\"><span class=\"c-no\">564</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"565\"><span class=\"c-no\">565</span><span class=\"c-src\">        - ``SET key &lt;random-token&gt; NX EX ttl_secs`` to claim the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"566\"><span class=\"c-no\">566</span><span class=\"c-src\">          lock atomically. Retries every</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"567\"><span class=\"c-no\">567</span><span class=\"c-src\">          ``_LOCK_RETRY_DELAY_SECS`` until acquired.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"568\"><span class=\"c-no\">568</span><span class=\"c-src\">        - A heartbeat task renews the TTL every ``ttl_secs / 2``</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"569\"><span class=\"c-no\">569</span><span class=\"c-src\">          seconds <span class=\"c-kw\">while</span> the body runs, so a long-running holder</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"570\"><span class=\"c-no\">570</span><span class=\"c-src\">          does <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> lose the lease.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"571\"><span class=\"c-no\">571</span><span class=\"c-src\">        - On exit, the heartbeat <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> cancelled <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> the lock <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"572\"><span class=\"c-no\">572</span><span class=\"c-src\">          released by GET-then-DEL guarded on the random token —</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"573\"><span class=\"c-no\">573</span><span class=\"c-src\">          we never delete a key whose value isn&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;t ours, so a</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"574\"><span class=\"c-no\">574</span><span class=\"c-src\">          process whose lease has already expired (<span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> been re-</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"575\"><span class=\"c-no\">575</span><span class=\"c-src\">          acquired by someone <span class=\"c-kw\">else</span>) cannot accidentally release</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"576\"><span class=\"c-no\">576</span><span class=\"c-src\">          the new holder&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s lock. The non-atomic GET+DEL race</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"577\"><span class=\"c-no\">577</span><span class=\"c-src\">          window opens only after the heartbeat <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> cancelled, <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"578\"><span class=\"c-no\">578</span><span class=\"c-src\">          a sub-millisecond span; the ``ttl_secs`` lease still has</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"579\"><span class=\"c-no\">579</span><span class=\"c-src\">          plenty of time left so the race effectively never</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"580\"><span class=\"c-no\">580</span><span class=\"c-src\">          materialises.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"581\"><span class=\"c-no\">581</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"582\"><span class=\"c-no\">582</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"583\"><span class=\"c-no\">583</span><span class=\"c-src\">            key (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"584\"><span class=\"c-no\">584</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Lock identifier.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"585\"><span class=\"c-no\">585</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ttl_secs (`int`, defaults to ``600``):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"586\"><span class=\"c-no\">586</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Lease duration; auto-renewed via heartbeat.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"587\"><span class=\"c-no\">587</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"588\"><span class=\"c-no\">588</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Yields:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"589\"><span class=\"c-no\">589</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`: <span class=\"c-kw\">while</span> the lock <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> held.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"590\"><span class=\"c-no\">590</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"591\"><span class=\"c-no\">591</span><span class=\"c-src\">        token = uuid.uuid4().hex</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"592\"><span class=\"c-no\">592</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># Acquire (poll until success).</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"593\"><span class=\"c-no\">593</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">while</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"594\"><span class=\"c-no\">594</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ok = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.set(key, token, nx=<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>, ex=ttl_secs)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"595\"><span class=\"c-no\">595</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> ok:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"596\"><span class=\"c-no\">596</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">break</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"597\"><span class=\"c-no\">597</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> asyncio.sleep(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._LOCK_RETRY_DELAY_SECS)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"598\"><span class=\"c-no\">598</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"599\"><span class=\"c-no\">599</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># Heartbeat: renew TTL every ttl/2 seconds.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"600\"><span class=\"c-no\">600</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _heartbeat() -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"601\"><span class=\"c-no\">601</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">while</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"602\"><span class=\"c-no\">602</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> asyncio.sleep(max(1.0, ttl_secs / 2))</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"603\"><span class=\"c-no\">603</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.expire(key, ttl_secs)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"604\"><span class=\"c-no\">604</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"605\"><span class=\"c-no\">605</span><span class=\"c-src\">        hb_task = asyncio.create_task(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"606\"><span class=\"c-no\">606</span><span class=\"c-src\">            _heartbeat(),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"607\"><span class=\"c-no\">607</span><span class=\"c-src\">            name=f<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;lock-heartbeat:{key}&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"608\"><span class=\"c-no\">608</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"609\"><span class=\"c-no\">609</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"610\"><span class=\"c-no\">610</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"611\"><span class=\"c-no\">611</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">yield</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"612\"><span class=\"c-no\">612</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">finally</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"613\"><span class=\"c-no\">613</span><span class=\"c-src\">            hb_task.cancel()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"614\"><span class=\"c-no\">614</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"615\"><span class=\"c-no\">615</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> hb_task</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"616\"><span class=\"c-no\">616</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">except</span> asyncio.CancelledError:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"617\"><span class=\"c-no\">617</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">pass</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"618\"><span class=\"c-no\">618</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># Release: only delete if the value still matches our</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"619\"><span class=\"c-no\">619</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># token. Failures are swallowed (the lease may have</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"620\"><span class=\"c-no\">620</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># expired naturally, in which case there is nothing to</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"621\"><span class=\"c-no\">621</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># do).</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"622\"><span class=\"c-no\">622</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"623\"><span class=\"c-no\">623</span><span class=\"c-src\">                current = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.get(key)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"624\"><span class=\"c-no\">624</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> current == token:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"625\"><span class=\"c-no\">625</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.delete(key)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"626\"><span class=\"c-no\">626</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">except</span> Exception:  <span class=\"c-com\"># pylint: disable=broad-except</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"627\"><span class=\"c-no\">627</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">pass</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"628\"><span class=\"c-no\">628</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"629\"><span class=\"c-no\">629</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> is_locked(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, key: str) -&gt; bool:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"630\"><span class=\"c-no\">630</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return whether ``key`` currently holds a lock.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"631\"><span class=\"c-no\">631</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"632\"><span class=\"c-no\">632</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"633\"><span class=\"c-no\">633</span><span class=\"c-src\">            key (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"634\"><span class=\"c-no\">634</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Lock identifier.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"635\"><span class=\"c-no\">635</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"636\"><span class=\"c-no\">636</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"637\"><span class=\"c-no\">637</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `bool`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"638\"><span class=\"c-no\">638</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>`` <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> Redis has a value at this key.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"639\"><span class=\"c-no\">639</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"640\"><span class=\"c-no\">640</span><span class=\"c-src\">        result = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._client.exists(key)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"641\"><span class=\"c-no\">641</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> bool(result)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"642\"><span class=\"c-no\">642</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>", "lines": 642, "explanation": "_redis_message_bus.py 来自 agentscope/QwenPaw 框架源码。结合左侧源码与右侧知识点理解此处设计意图；点「反向链接」可回到引用它的教程章节。", "knowledge_points": [{"title": "多 Agent 编排", "body": "服务层 Team 工具（TeamCreate/AgentCreate/TeamSay）+ MessageBus（InMemory/Redis）；Leader 动态调度 Worker；非 1.0 代码 pipeline；MultiAgentManager 管生命周期零停机重载。"}], "related_docs": ["W08-RAG与多Agent-Team与服务化", "01-Agent范式", "02-消息与编排"]};
